        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As such, we operate our business in two segments.",
        "start_character": 13757,
        "end_character": 13806
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we are capitalizing on our Platform’s success connecting freight forwarders to airlines by offering the same freight forwarder connections to ocean liners.",
        "start_character": 34724,
        "end_character": 34892
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Platform segment, we connect Buyers and Sellers of freight services to provide digitalized price quoting, booking, payments and basic shipment management.",
        "start_character": 13807,
        "end_character": 13968
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer access to payment services from financial partners, and provide access to third-party cargo insurance and to in-house and third-party customs brokerage services.",
        "start_character": 25228,
        "end_character": 25403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate disclosing personal data to persons who provide services to us and their respective affiliates (which may include certain entities located outside the US, the Cayman Islands, Israel or the European Economic Area), who will process your personal data on our behalf.",
        "start_character": 79649,
        "end_character": 79927
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are continuously monitoring our compliance with these national security directives to ensure that our offerings do not run afoul of these increasingly stringent data-localization and technology-transfer restrictions.",
        "start_character": 66791,
        "end_character": 67010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate a platform business and we believe, over time, our most important revenue stream will be Platform revenue.",
        "start_character": 30428,
        "end_character": 30545
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will remain an emerging growth company until the earliest of: (i) the last day of the fiscal year (a) following the fifth anniversary of the date on which Freightos Ordinary Shares were offered in exchange for Gesher Ordinary Shares in connection with the Transactions (which will be December 31, 2028), (b) in which we have total annual gross revenue of at least $1.235 billion, or (c) in which we are deemed to be a large accelerated filer, which means the market value of our common equity that is held by non-affiliates exceeds $700 million as of the last business day of our most recently completed second fiscal quarter;",
        "start_character": 4022,
        "end_character": 4651
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we consider Freightos to be a payments platform, we are not licensed to perform money transmission or to offer payment terms or credit in jurisdictions where these activities are regulated.",
        "start_character": 80998,
        "end_character": 81196
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As our Platform matures, we have also expanded our Solutions stack to support enterprise organizations with market intelligence and tender management.",
        "start_character": 28580,
        "end_character": 28730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Every search on our Platform relies on layers of industry digitalization and algorithms, often spanning both carriers and forwarders, which we have meticulously developed over ten years.",
        "start_character": 13245,
        "end_character": 13431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-034941",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-034941-8300a19720f776ba",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-034941",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For this reason, while travel marketplaces often rely on third-party global distribution systems, we developed and operate both layers of our Platform, WebCargo by Freightos and freightos.com, as illustrated in the following graphic.",
        "start_character": 24418,
        "end_character": 24651
      }
    ]
  },
